@startuml post-manager-company-pk-merge
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title POST /api/manager/v1/company/{pk}/merge
caption CRB-68 · 회사 병합: {pk}(원본)의 이름 · 현업자를 target 으로 옮기고 원본 삭제

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "AdminCompanyController" as Controller
participant "AdminCompanyService" as Service
participant "AdminCompanyRepository" as AdminCompanyRepository
participant "AdminAuditLogRepository" as AdminAuditLogRepository
participant "FileService" as FileService
database PostgreSQL
participant "S3"

Client -> Guard: POST /api/manager/v1/company/{pk}/merge\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>\n{ target_id }
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt pk · target_id 가 양의 정수가 아님
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: merge(pk, req, manager)
Controller -> Service: merge(sourcePk, targetPk, manager)
alt sourcePk = targetPk
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 Cannot merge a company into itself
end
note right of Service
  예: 사용자가 직접 입력해 생긴 "마이크로소프트"(needs_review) 를
  어드민이 등록한 "Microsoft" 로 병합
end note

group transaction (DatabaseService.db.transaction)
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: findByPksForUpdate([source, target], tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT company_alias WHERE pk IN (?, ?)\nORDER BY pk FOR UPDATE
  note right
    pk 순서로 잠가 교착 방지.
    사용자 프로필 저장의 FOR KEY SHARE 와 직렬화
    → 병합 중 원본을 고른 저장은 커밋 뒤 404 Company not found
  end note
  PostgreSQL --> AdminCompanyRepository: rows
  alt 둘 중 하나라도 없음
    Service -[#red]-> Client: 404 Company not found
  end

  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: moveNames(source, target, tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE company_name SET alias_pk = target WHERE alias_pk = source
  note right: 원본 이름("마이크로소프트" 등)도 target 의 name 으로 남음 → 이후 입력 · 검색은 Microsoft
  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: moveProfiles(source, target, tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE graduated_profile SET company_alias_pk = target\nWHERE company_alias_pk = source

  opt target 에 로고가 없고 원본에 로고가 있음
    Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: updateLogo(target, source.logo_key, tx)
    AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: UPDATE company_alias SET logo_key = ?, updated_at = now()
    note right: 원본 로고를 넘겨받음 (지울 파일 없음)
  end

  Service -> AdminCompanyRepository: delete(source, tx)
  AdminCompanyRepository -> PostgreSQL: DELETE company_alias WHERE pk = source
  note right: FK 는 NO ACTION. 자식(name · profile)을 먼저 옮겼으므로 통과
  Service -> AdminAuditLogRepository: insert({ adminEmail, action: "company.merge", targetType: "company", targetId: source pk,\nbefore: { source: { name, needs_review, logo_key, names }, target: { ... } },\nafter: { target: { ... }, moved_graduated_count } }, tx)
  AdminAuditLogRepository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT admin_audit_log
  note right: CRB-81 · flow/admin-audit.puml. 기록이 실패하면 변경도 rollback. 변경 전 · 후 값은 회사 이름 · 표기 · 로고 key만 (현업자 정보 제외)
end
note over Service, PostgreSQL: 트랜잭션 안의 예외는 전부 rollback 후 응답

opt 원본 로고를 넘겨받지 않음 (target 에 이미 로고가 있음)
  Service -> FileService: deleteFileQuietly(source.logo_key)
  FileService -> S3: DeleteObject
  note right: 커밋 뒤에 지움. 실패하면 로그만 (OrphanFileService 가 나중에 정리)
end

Service --> Controller: AdminCompanyDto (target)
Controller --> Client: 200 { company_id, name, logo_url | null, needs_review,\nnames, graduated_count, created_at }
note right of Client: target 의 needs_review 는 그대로 둠

@enduml
